@host = https://localhost:7267
# Dán test token có quyền phù hợp; không dùng credential thật trong file này.
@accessToken = paste-test-token-here
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Anonymous health smoke
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Requires REQUEST_VIEW_OWN
GET {{host}}/api/VPPRequest/period-info
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Requires PERMISSION_VIEW
GET {{host}}/api/Permission/groups
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Authenticated order history; replace the placeholder order ID when needed.
GET {{host}}/api/VPPRequest/orders/{{orderId}}/history
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
